@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-06
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-06 v2. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v2 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
' Message 10 is Izk of tb, drawn as I_k of t_b.
' PREP names the Prep action.
component OP
' entity OP: Operator
component MS
' entity MS: Msess / session
component MP
' entity MP: Mprot / protocol
component AN
' entity AN: Analysis / and diagnosis
OP --> MS : m1 1  start (H_0)
MS --> MS : m2 2  Admit: overlapping classes stay strictly reducing
MS --> MS : m3 3  uninformative TEST is not admitted
MS --> MS : m4 4  select PREP from A
MS --> MP : m5 5  PREP action
MP ..> MS : m6 6  q_{k+1}
MS --> MS : m7 7  select distinguishing TEST t_b
MS --> MP : m8 8  execute t_b
MP ..> MS : m9 9  observation separating h_1 / h_2
MS --> AN : m10 10  I_k of t_b
AN ..> MS : m11 11  H_k singleton, or still indistinguishable
note as NT
  H_0 = {h_{normal}} ∪ H_{single}; admission, resource and recovery rules as in Alg. 1.
end note
note as legend
  Legend: message; reply
end note
@enduml
